  "description": "The proposed upgrade of a telecommunications base station comprising the removal of 3 no existing antennas and replacement with 6 no antennas and 2 no dishes together with the internal upgrade of existing equipment room and ancillary development thereto on the rooftop of Church Studios with a new proposed height of 31.33m AGL.",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: 100 Rev. A; 200 Rev. A; 201 Rev. A; 300 Rev. A; 301 Rev. A; 302 Rev. A; 303 Rev. A; 304 Rev. A; 305 Rev. A; 306 Rev. A; 307 Rev. A; Cover Letter from Cornerstone dated 27th February 2026 (x 2 pages); Notice Covering Letter from Cornerstone (x 2 pages); Merged Pre Con Letters and Responses from Cornerstone dated 4th February 2026 (x 19 pages); Brochure from the Institution of Engineering and Technology - 2nd Edition dated 2020 (x 12 pages); Local Authority Engagement Brochure from Cornerstone (x 10 pages); Letter from the Department for Digital, Culture, Media & Sport and Ministry of Housing, Communities & Local Government dated 7th March 2019 (x 2 pages); Digital Public Benefit Brochure from Cornerstone (x 5 pages); 5G, EMF Exposure and Safety Brochure dated 2020 (x 12 pages); Health and Mobile Phone Base Stations Brochure from Cornerstone dated 11/05/2021 (x 3 pages); HM Government Ofcom 5G Guide (x 4 pages); Letter from the Department for Digital, Culture, Media & Sport dated November 2019 (x 2 pages); Letter from the Department for Digital, Culture, Media & Sport dated 24 May 2021 (x 3 pages); Mobile UK Digital Inclusion Report (x 18 pages); Mobile UK 5G Local Authority Toolkit (x 12 pages); Mobile UK Health Fact Sheet (x 2 pages); Online Nation 2022 Report (x 128 pages); Radio Planning and Propagation (V.4 November 2019) (x 3 pages); Article from the Times from Sir Keir Starmer dated 5 December 2024 (x 4 pages); Letter from the Department for Science, Innovation & Technology dated 29 November 2024 (x 3 pages); Cornerstone Community Information Sheet (Health Summary) (x 2 pages); Cornerstone Community Information Sheet (Coverage and Capacity) (x 1 page); Cornerstone Community Information Sheet (How it Works) (x 1 page); Cornerstone Community Information Sheet (Planning for a better network) (x 2 pages); Cornerstone Community Information Sheet (5G Services) (x 3 ",
    "Condition : 3 - All new external work shall be carried out in materials that resemble, as closely as possible, in colour and texture those of the existing building, unless otherwise specified in the approved application. \r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area in accordance with the requirements of policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017. \r\n"
  ],
